      "content": "i know i should talk to them but my doctor is super hard to reach and i have a massive exam coming up next week. i really need the adderall to focus or i'm gonna fail. like, it's not like my heart is actually hurting or anything, it's just a little bit of jitters. is there a way i can just take a lower dose so it doesn't clash with the thyroid thing? or maybe just take it at night? i just need some actual guidance on how to manage it till i can see them.",
